24
00:01:12.366 --> 00:01:14.333
So let's see what happens if we do 1.5,

25
00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.133
0.5, and 1.5.

26
00:01:19.266 --> 00:01:21.100
I'll just make it all round, too.

27
00:01:22.466 --> 00:01:23.866
Cool.

28
00:01:23.866 --> 00:01:25.966
