33
00:01:37.533 --> 00:01:39.433
It looks pretty good.

34
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:43.500
Think it fits around nicely.

35
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.433
Yeah, cool, that's fine.

36
00:01:45.433 --> 00:01:46.633
